tp://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>τ</mi><mi>n</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</p>","file":"ch45-quantile-gamlss/02-quantile-regression.html"}